57	        )}
58	      </div>
59	
60	      <p className="mb-4 text-sm text-slate-400">
61	        Connect the Cloudflare account that holds your domains and we can set DNS up for you: mail
62	        records for Business Email, pointing a website at its server, and moving your domains after a
63	        migration. We only ask to {scopeSummary}, and we only ever touch the records you ask us to —
64	        we never read your traffic, change your settings, or delete anything else. DNS changes can
65	        take a few minutes to reach everyone.
66	      </p>
67	
68	      {error && (
